// MSExchange Transport Agent Installation | T1505.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_powershell_msexchange_transport_agent.yml
CommandLine:*Install\-TransportAgent*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "CommandLine:*Install\\-TransportAgent*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
